3,Nahuatl - Endangered Language Alliance,https://www.elalliance.org/languages/nahuatl,"Linguists have classified Nahuatl as belonging to the Aztecan branch of the Uto-Aztecan language family, which extends as far north as eastern Oregon.","Nahuatl, Tabasco",Uto-Aztecan
